msgid "Clear Stuck DLM"
msgstr "Clear Stuck DLM"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/troubleshooting.rst:279
msgid ""
"Do not clear DLM fencing manually as a general recovery procedure. If the"
" Agent does not resolve the fence after the failed host is demonstrably "
"isolated, contact HPE Support with the collected quorum, DLM, storage-"
"path, and Agent evidence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/troubleshooting.rst:282
msgid "Force Restart Cluster Services"
msgstr "Force Reiniciar Cluster Services"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/troubleshooting.rst:284
msgid ""
"systemctl restart corosync\n"
"systemctl restart dlm"
msgstr ""
"systemctl reiniciar corosync\n"
"systemctl reiniciar dlm"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/troubleshooting.rst:289
msgid ""
"Use extreme caution restarting cluster services in production. This will "
"temporarily disrupt cluster communication and may trigger fencing of the "
"restarted node."
msgstr ""
"Usar extreme caution restarting cluster servicios en production. Este "
"será temporarily disrupt cluster communication y puede trigger fencing "
"del reiniciado nodo."

